  "headline": "Government Opens 154,052 CPNS 2026 Positions Starting November 27",
  "seoTitle": "Kementerian Kehutanan and CPNS 2026 Recruitment Starts",
  "metaDescription": "The Indonesian government has officially opened registration for 154,052 CPNS 2026 positions on November 27 via the official SSCASN portal for applicants.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Registration for 154,052 civil servant positions officially opened on November 27, 2026, through the national SSCASN portal.",
    "The selection process includes specific testing requirements such as SKD assessments comprising 110 questions to be completed within 100 minutes.",
    "Special provisions allow PPPK teachers over age 35 to participate in designated CPNS recruitment categories."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian government has launched its 2026 civil servant (CPNS) recruitment cycle, offering 154,052 positions to prospective applicants. The application window officially commenced on November 27, 2026, with candidates required to submit documentation via the official SSCASN portal managed by the State Civil Service Agency (BKN). Significant portions of the available vacancies are concentrated within the forestry sector. To accommodate widespread participation, the government has established 143 examination locations, allowing candidates to complete their assessments outside of BKN offices. The selection criteria involve a Basic Competency Selection (SKD) consisting of 110 test items with a 100-minute time limit. Furthermore, President Prabowo has introduced special policies to permit contract-based government teachers (PPPK) over 35 years of age to apply for specific CPNS vacancies, aiming to integrate experienced educational professionals into the permanent civil service workforce.",
  "whyItIsViral": "The recruitment announcement is viral due to extensive coverage across four independent national media outlets and high public search interest regarding Ministry of Forestry allocations.",
